{"product_id":"horrid-henry-rocks","title":"Horrid Henry Rocks","description":"\u003cp\u003eFour new stories: Horrid Henry's Invasion - Horrid Henry and Perfect Peter keep invading each other's rooms. Moody Margaret's Sleepover - Moody Margaret invites all the members of the Secret Club for a sleepover, with catastrophic results. Horrid Henry's Autobiography - Miss Battle-Axe's class all have to write their autobiographies, the best to be published in the local paper. Horrid Henry Rocks - Horrid Henry wants to go to the Killerboy Rats concert while his family want to go to the Daffy and her Dancing Daisies concert.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 197 x 131\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Francesca Simon\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781842551349\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 112\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45674997055641,"sku":"1RB9781842551349","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/71r32usYS-L.jpg?v=1756278546","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/horrid-henry-rocks","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}